  "$D=\\{0\\le x\\le {@0},\\ 0\\le y\\le x\\}$. $\\displaystyle\\int_0^{{@1}}\\int_0^{x}({@2})\\,dy\\,dx=\\int_0^{{@3}}\\left({@4}\\right)dx={@5}\\cdot\\frac{{@6}^3}{3}={@7}$.": "$D=\\{0\\le x\\le {@0},\\ 0\\le y\\le x\\}$ です。$\\displaystyle\\int_0^{{@1}}\\int_0^{x}({@2})\\,dy\\,dx=\\int_0^{{@3}}\\left({@4}\\right)dx={@5}\\cdot\\frac{{@6}^3}{3}={@7}$.",
